THOUGHT: getListEntry(int, int) is explicitly annotated @Nullable, so dereferencing it without a check causes the NullAway error. In refresh(), there are three dereferences of getListEntry(column, row): for setImage, setText (non-null content), and setText("") in the else branch. To fix only the reported error while keeping behavior, I should store getListEntry(column, row) in a local variable, check it for null once per loop iteration, and only perform setImage/setText when it’s non-null. This will also safely cover the other two dereferences without changing logic. I’ll modify refresh() accordingly and then run the Gradle compile to confirm the NullAway error count decreases by one.

```bash
cd /home/vscode/nullness-benchmarks/litiengine && sed -i '266,297s/^/@@@/;' src/de/gurkenlabs/litiengine/gui/ListField.java && perl -0pi -e 's/@@@  public void refresh\(\) {
@@@    for \(int column = 0; column < this.getNumberOfShownColumns\(\); column\+\+\) {
@@@      for \(int row = 0; row < this.getNumberOfShownRows\(\); row\+\+\) {
@@@        if \(this.getContent\(\)\[column\].length <= row\) {
@@@          continue;
@@@        }
@@@
@@@        if \(row \+ this.getVerticalLowerBound\(\)
@@@                < this.getContent\(\)\[column \+ this.getHorizontalLowerBound\(\)\].length
@@@            && this.getContent\(\)\[column \+ this.getHorizontalLowerBound\(\)\]\[
@@@                    row \+ this.getVerticalLowerBound\(\)\]
@@@                != null\) {
@@@          if \(this.getContent\(\)\[column \+ this.getHorizontalLowerBound\(\)\]\[
@@@                  row \+ this.getVerticalLowerBound\(\)\]
@@@              instanceof Image\) {
@@@            this.getListEntry\(column, row\)
@@@                .setImage\(
@@@                    \(Image\)
@@@                        this.getContent\(\)\[column \+ this.getHorizontalLowerBound\(\)\]\[
@@@                            row \+ this.getVerticalLowerBound\(\)\]\);
@@@          } else {
@@@            this.getListEntry\(column, row\)
@@@                .setText\(
@@@                    this
@@@                        .getContent\(\)\[column \+ this.getHorizontalLowerBound\(\)\]\[
@@@                        row \+ this.getVerticalLowerBound\(\)\]
@@@                        .toString\(\)\);
@@@          }
@@@        } else {
@@@          this.getListEntry\(column, row\).setText\(""\);
@@@        }
@@@      }
@@@    }
/  public void refresh() {
    for (int column = 0; column < this.getNumberOfShownColumns(); column++) {
      for (int row = 0; row < this.getNumberOfShownRows(); row++) {
        if (this.getContent()[column].length <= row) {
          continue;
        }

        ImageComponent entry = this.getListEntry(column, row);
        if (entry == null) {
          continue;
        }

        if (row + this.getVerticalLowerBound()
                < this.getContent()[column + this.getHorizontalLowerBound()].length
            && this.getContent()[column + this.getHorizontalLowerBound()][
                    row + this.getVerticalLowerBound()]
                != null) {
          if (this.getContent()[column + this.getHorizontalLowerBound()][
                  row + this.getVerticalLowerBound()]
              instanceof Image) {
            entry.setImage(
                (Image)
                    this.getContent()[column + this.getHorizontalLowerBound()][
                        row + this.getVerticalLowerBound()]);
          } else {
            entry.setText(
                this
                    .getContent()[column + this.getHorizontalLowerBound()][
                    row + this.getVerticalLowerBound()]
                    .toString());
          }
        } else {
          entry.setText("");
        }
      }
    }
/;' src/de/gurkenlabs/litiengine/gui/ListField.java && ./gradlew compileJava -x test -q > new_build_output.log 2>&1 && grep -E "NullAway:.*errors" -n new_build_output.log || tail -n 40 new_build_output.log```

